<title>USA: Dime Capital Trust I sets $200 mln capital secs.</title>
<headline>Dime Capital Trust I sets $200 mln capital secs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital preferred securities from Dime Capital Trust I, was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Dime Capital Trust I is a trust set up by Dime Bancorp to issue the securities.</p>
<p>BORROWER DIME CAPITAL TRUST I</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 9.33 PCT   MATURITY 5/6/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAP PFD SECS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 11/6/1997 LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 9.33 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD +230 BP    CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
